          <groundspeak:finder id="1151545">Ringrat</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP327 Riverbend [FOUND]

I was in the vicinity Earthcaching on this beautiful Thanksgiving weekend and certainly couldn't pass up looking for a cap only a few metres away. I tripped over the depression while looking at my GPS which made for an easy find. Some clearing of dirt and leaves revealed the cap and some water was employed to try and distinguish any marks but this one's well and truly battered and not a single marking is decipherable...so I'm just going to post the photo here!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
