          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP327- Riverbend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N 53° 28.394 W 113° 35.350&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Another cap with a terrific view. Came up here with my younger son this afternoon after a trip out to run an errand. I've been up here lots, as we live nearby and I have an earthcache in this park. The cap itself is in rough shape. I find it interesting that it is located and the highest point in the park- I wonder if that is intentional? Thanks for another one, outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="681367937">
