          <groundspeak:finder id="7458582">mkPerry</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP327 Riverbend

Grabbed a few more BCPs this afternoon. Great view from up here. I didn't know this was here. Saw a little wildlife (rabbit) then was on my way. 

Thanks outforthehunt for another BCP. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
